    "detailed_description": "A retro-style RPG with modern MMO style combat! Step into a strange and lonely world full of even stranger and lonlier characters as you grow your moxie, discover new ways of being, and maybe even find a new love?<br><br>Your path will not be easy. This is a difficult game with obtuse logic governing it. If you're up to the challenge, take your first steps into... <i>GENNIBAR-SIX</i>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A surreal and absurd world to explore<br></li><li> Tab-targeted, class-based MMO gameplay<br></li><li> Play single player, with your friends, or with people from around the world<br></li><li> Endlessly generated wastes<br></li><li> Creative itemization from strange merchants<br></li><li> Challenging bosses<br></li><li> Grappling hooks<br></li><li> Cool hats for player customization<br></li><li> Fishing<br></li><li> Snakes?</li></ul>",
